  "content": "<p>FTB 出品的适用于 Minecraft 1.18 及以上版本的最新备份模组。</p><h2>⚠ LTS 公告！</h2><blockquote>\n  <p>FTB Backups (2) 仅适用于 Minecraft 1.21.5 及以下版本，现已进入长期支持（LTS）阶段。我们将继续修复模组漏洞，但不再接受新功能请求。</p>\n  <p>如需最新功能，请使用适用于更新版本的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-backups-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Backups 3</a>（1.21.1 至最新版本）</p>\n</blockquote><h2>功能特点</h2><ul>\n<li>静默备份，消息仅向管理员显示或向所有人广播</li>\n<li>可配置保留的备份数量</li>\n<li>仅在有玩家在线且数据已保存时才进行备份</li>\n<li>可配置定时器，采用 Cron 表达式实现深度备份时间控制</li>\n<li>备份元数据以 JSON 文件存储，便于开发功能丰富的备份管理界面</li>\n<li>支持添加额外目录到备份中</li>\n<li>自动选择最佳备份压缩等级</li>\n<li>确保新备份有足够磁盘空间，防止备份过程中磁盘耗尽导致存档损坏</li>\n</ul><h2>指令</h2><ul>\n<li>/backup create - 立即执行备份</li>\n<li>/backup snapshot - 创建受保护免于自动清理的备份</li>\n</ul><h2>支持渠道</h2><ul>\n<li>关于<strong>整合包</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>关于<strong>模组</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有疑问？加入我们的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>保持关注</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
